"""Claude Profile Switcher for Linux.

Runs several Claude desktop accounts side by side, each in a data folder of its own
(Electron's --user-data-dir), as the Windows and macOS switchers do. Works with Anthropic's
claude-desktop package and with the community claude-desktop-unofficial build.

Run it with no arguments for the window (GTK 3), or see --help for the command line.
Unofficial; not affiliated with Anthropic. MIT License.
"""

